{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35622","headline":"下第卧疾卢员外召游曲江 · 李山甫","name":"下第卧疾卢员外召游曲江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眼前何事不伤神，忍向江头更弄春。\n桂树既能欺贱子，杏花争肯采闲人。\n麻衣未掉浑身雪，皁盖难遮满面尘。\n珍重列星相借问，嵇康慵病也天真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}